  <item>
    <title>Ep03. 我们为什么会选择「爱工作」？祝你也玩得开心！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f7e95b81cdab3a93b12ccb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f7e95b81cdab3a93b12ccb</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 28 Sep 2024 11:32:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi，本周的播客虽迟但到，希望大家听得开心！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期探讨了很多关于工作方面的话题，尤其是关于【我们为什么爱工作】，欢迎大家和我们讨论你的观点！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>📒</span><strong><span>Show notes】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a> 我们俩本质上都是很爱工作的人（或者说爱劳动）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="277">04:37</a> 关于婷婷子的职场生涯：工作虐我千百遍，我待工作如初恋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1007">16:47</a> 婷婷子最大的收获是明确了自己想要的生活的工作（并且做到了）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1123">18:43</a> 凝凝子的【好学生心态】驱使，总是想寻找那个命中注定的工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1554">25:54</a> 探讨两人的不同选择：在同一份工作上坚持or不断寻找适合自己的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2105">35:05</a> 我们是可以选择不工作的，甚至可以去体验一下不工作是什么状态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2620">43:40</a> 工作让我们真正成为一个成年人，进入真实的世界🌍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3088">51:28</a> 擅长合作/独自工作的形式，可能对职场有不一样的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3491">58:11</a> 不再追求完美和一步到位，而是可以有耐心和时间逐渐达到自己的目标</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4285">1:11:25</a> 工作可以不是【工作】，可以是自我提升的空间or游戏场，全看你如何定义</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>📖</span><strong><span>相关阅读】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>停更的这段时间我们也依然在过自己的【一手人生】</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎来看看我们的weekly review</span></p><span></span><p><span>婷婷子的两周更新：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/z7odlcW2xnw4ztXnR5wyGw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/z7odlcW2xnw4ztXnR5wyGw"><span>weekly03：从没想过一周会如此漫长，又这么猛烈迅速</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/GaixKZRdnXlxrQAWzlm80A" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/GaixKZRdnXlxrQAWzlm80A"><span>weekly04：像夏天一样，迅速、热烈，又回味悠长</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>🎵</span><strong><span>BGM】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>开场音乐：Westlife - Fly Me to the Moon</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾音乐：92914 - Sunset</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqLPIKEAccFGawhqErTfw_oezPPL.m4a" length="75598646" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:17:49</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpLkwF2BWhoHADJN7Qrx2EJCFLEy.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep02. 明明渴望着一段亲密关系，却又逃避人群</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e04c56ee04007d889647e8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e04c56ee04007d889647e8</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Sep 2024 13:40:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi，本周的播客按时送达，希望大家听得开心！本期探讨了很多关于人际关系方面的话题，欢迎大家和我们讨论你的观点！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【📒Show notes】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="54">00:54</a> 揭秘《一手人生》播客名字的由来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="151">02:31</a> 先来听听看什么叫“二手人生”吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a> 如果人生是个游戏，你会翻攻略吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="846">14:06</a> 真的有人能做到不评判相亲对象吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1209">20:09</a> 今年读到的“人生之书”——《被讨厌的勇气》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1461">24:21</a> 一边渴望关系一边逃避进入关系，怎么办</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1583">26:23</a> 为什么看到别人的成功，会觉得是我的失败</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1943">32:23</a> 爱是一个决定，它需要勇气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2173">36:13</a> 如果不去预防，坏事就会降临</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2471">41:11</a> 起伏才是人生的常态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2785">46:25</a> “与万物浮沉于生长之门”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3244">54:04</a> 让自己快乐的第一责任人是我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3399">56:39</a> 其实我想要，但我就不说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3887">1:04:47</a> 鼓起勇气去做了，才发现没人在看我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4388">1:13:08</a> 第一次记账，要如何坚持下来</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【📖相关阅读】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/0FF0at0GTRJWPFVnR-rkIQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/0FF0at0GTRJWPFVnR-rkIQ"><span>weekly02：有波折，有风浪，才是精彩的人生啊</span></a><span>（婷婷的Weekly Review）</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/rca6WQVhtuvhs0XZ9IkmMg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/rca6WQVhtuvhs0XZ9IkmMg"><span>Weekly 01|保持心中的欲望而无需为之辩护</span></a><span> （凝子的Weekly Review）</span></p><span></span><p><span>《被讨厌的勇气》岸见一郎、古贺史健</span></p><span></span><p><span>《幸福的勇气》岸见一郎、古贺史健</span></p><span></span><p><span>《三大师传》茨威格</span></p><span></span><p><span>《创新者的困境》塔尼亚·卡坦</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【🎵BGM】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《Second Date》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkizVqRGelu5uSdObX-sJi9Yhhqm.m4a" length="76148300" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:17:37</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpLkwF2BWhoHADJN7Qrx2EJCFLEy.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep01. 完美主义是高级定制版本的恐惧</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d5a2444a0f950f84f81abc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d5a2444a0f950f84f81abc</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Sep 2024 11:32:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期是《一手人生》的诞生日记，这个新鲜诞生的播客源于我们两个好朋友之间的一次weekly chat。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="68">01:08</a> casual chat：凝子回高中母校的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="158">02:38</a> 为什么突然诞生了weekly chat的想法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="322">05:22</a> 没有记录等于无事发生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="469">07:49</a> 凝子8月份印象最深刻的事——奥运会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="551">09:11</a> 在紫薇星成为神之前</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="707">11:47</a> 婷婷8月份的主题——成为舞蹈教练</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="881">14:41</a> Chat GPT教我怎么不紧张</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">20:30</a> 打破恐惧以后发现一切轻而易举</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1715">28:35</a> 灵感来了你不接待，它就走了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1897">31:37</a> 完美主义是高级定制版本的恐惧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1943">32:23</a> 如何打破拖延</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2232">37:12</a> 降低预期以后，每件事情都是惊喜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2505">41:45</a> 下班后连上两节团课的体力是怎么养成的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2947">49:07</a> 半年10万字的日记是怎么被创作出来的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3081">51:21</a> 在你的生活中设计出“最小阻力之路”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3777">1:02:57</a> 下一周的展望，希望下周还能更新</span></p><span></span><p><span>📖相关阅读</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/T1tX40wfoqjn8MBi03gBcQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/T1tX40wfoqjn8MBi03gBcQ"><span>weekly01：一切开始都是最好的开始</span></a><span> （婷婷的Weekly Review）</span></p><span></span><p><span>《去当你想当的任何人吧》伊丽莎白·吉尔伯特</span></p><span></span><p><span>《微习惯》斯蒂芬·盖斯</span></p><span></span><p><span>《最小阻力之路》罗伯特·弗里茨</span></p><span></span><p><span>《告别情绪性进食的DBT方法》</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵BGM：Second Date</span></p>]]></description>
